  "short_answer": "Autel EVO Max 4N offers two categories: Signal Lost behavior (Return to Home, Hover, Land) and Signal Loss Action (Continue mission, Auto RTH). Reconnection is attempted after loss of C2 link; if not restored within 10 seconds, the app shows a warning and executes the configured Signal Loss Action / behavior. The incident report notes a loss of control after takeoff, underscoring the importance of these settings in practice.",
